User"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2306562216,"name":"Camping","desc":"Welcome to Camping, an incredible adventure themed game designed to deliver the ultimate camping experience to you and your friends. In a group of 12, you will travel deep into the woods, and survive in the wilderness. Enjoy time exploring the wonders of the forest, telling stories by the campfire, and MUCH more.\r\n\r\nThis game was built and scripted by me. It is also a remake to an original version I made years ago!","path":"/game/2306562216-camping","slug":"2306562216-camping","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/35102f3c6f01545b9b147d4baf1333be9be3c0e2f8e09133dfbc3c63a1c0334e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8b057633e209ff13f8697d34b8068292/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":18,"visitor":299890350,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-23T20:18:39.656Z","creator":{"name":"SamsonXVI","type":"User"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":4733728555,"name":"SCP: Site-43 RP FR","desc":"SCP: Site-43 | RP FR\n\nImagine a universe where creatures and paranormal phenomena truly exist. In this universe, an organization would have been created to hide them from the eyes of the population and to avoid causing widespread panic.\nThis organization is the SCP Foundation.\nThe SCP Foundation would gather several sites around the world, most of which would aim to contain these paranormal creatures.\n\nIn this French game, you can play as a staff member (guard, scientist, doctor) or become an enemy, and try to free the creatures, called < SCP >.\n\nRules: devforum.roblox.com/t/1472624","path":"/game/4733728555-scp-site-43-rp-fr","slug":"4733728555-scp-site-43-rp-fr","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8eae99049fd85af4e27380c2f5d825f492ed116bbc94757afc7120107883a5e3.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bcdef1a5cccc88814db1683317734f7e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":18,"visitor":3391